1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Brita’s husband Josef was involved in municipal affairs, in his younger years did a lot of silversmithing and was skilled at various other jobs. He worked with, among other things, a seeding machine, and a navar, t
2 CONC o drill water springs, which are now in the museum at Mølster. Brita was a good missionary friend and was the first to give money to an orphanage in Voss. Josef died in 1876 and Brita in 1906. They had children: Anna born 1844, in
2 CONC  1868 marrried Nils Larsson Finnesteigen, Lars born 1845, in 1870 married  Ingjerd Josefsdatter Lid, Gudve born 1848, married Nils Davidson Gjerdåk of Løno, Steffa born 1851, died in America, Maria born 1855, married Olav Gitleson
2 CONC  Opeland of Øvre Lid, Brita born 1858, died unmarried 1906, Olav born 1861, Nils born 1864.
