1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Olav now owns a house at no. 192, use 45 in Haugamoen where they live. He was mayor for 14 years, deputy mayor for a long time and has held many positions of trust in the county and the county. Participated in the 
2 CONC organization of Voss Sagbrukinteresentskap, Voss Veksel- og Landmandsbank, l/l Trelastforretningen and Palmafossen power station. Deputy member of the Storting 1898-1900 and 1910-15 and member of the Storting 1922-1927, bank direc
2 CONC tor, member of the national board of the Norges Bondelag, of the agricultural council, the ministerial grain commission, unemployment board, chairman of Hordaland Landbruksselskap, on the board of Hordaland Landbruksskule and Vest
2 CONC landske Salslag.
