2 DATE 22 OCT 1760
2 PLAC Mo'o, Granvin, Hardanger, Hordaland, Norway
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE 1823
2 PLAC Øvre Himle, Bordals, Voss, Hordaland, Norway
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1823
2 ADDR
3 CITY Vossevangen
3 STAE Hordaland
