2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT http://iagenweb.org/boards/winneshiek/obituaries/index.cgi?read=308784
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Murl's obituary from the Mabel Record of 29, April, 1932.
2 CONT
2 CONT Murl Nelson, 34, Mabel cream hauler, died Wednesday morning at the St. Francis hospital in La Crosse, where he had undergone an operation for ulcers of the stomach a week before. His mother, Mrs. Chas. Hackett, was with him at the
2 CONC  hospital at his death.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services will be held at the Hesper Friends church Sunday afternoon at 2 o'clock. Burial will be in the Hesper public cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Nelson was born in Winneshiek county October 12, 1987. He was a bachelor, and besides his step father and mother, Mr. and Mrs. Chas. Hacket of this neighborhood, he is survived by the following brothers and sisters: Guy, of Ma
2 CONC bel; Mrs. Knute Sanden, Hesper; Mrs. Lawris Flatten, Mabel; Mrs. Andrew Folkedahl, Highlandville; Miss Ruby Nelson, at home; and Norvel and Nels at home.
