1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Buried in an unmarked grave. Born in Leeds Township, Wisconsin, to Knut G. Fadness and Inger B. Skjerveggen. Married Claus Lohne- Henderson. ( Once immigrated to U.S the family changed their surname from Lohne to H
2 CONC enderson) They had the following children: Henry, Emma, Betsy, Ingeborg, Ingeborg C.,Amanda, Knut, Rose, Carl B., Carl J.,Martin, and Louis. Claus was rumored to have been previously married to a Bertha Alreck and had a child Marg
2 CONC retha b 1860- but this information is not yet proven. Claus died 3 October 1926 in Velva Township, ND, buried at an unknown location. Gjertine died in Colburn Township, Wisconsin, in Chippewa County.
2 CONT
2 CONT Knut Gulleiksson Fadnes married a second time in 1848 to Inger Brynjulvsdatter Skjerveggen (1813) and immigrated in 1848. He became farmer in Spring Prairie, WI and is buried there. They had three more children. With Inger he had,
2 CONC  Gjertine, Inger, Helge These 3 children born in Leeds Township, Wisconsin, where he died as well. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
