1 NOTE Information on Rachel are that 1) the 1880 US Census for Freeborn county list her as Rachel, age 43.  Then, looking at when Rachel's husband, Andrew Davidson, emigrated, he is listed as emigrating in 1868.  Looking at others who e
2 CONC migrated in 1868 and born in 1836, the only entry beginning with R (Rachel is not a Norwegian name) we find Ragnhild Andersdtr. Øksendal.  The Øksendal farm, in Vaksdal, is near Gulbrå and Tveite just west over the mountain from M
2 CONC yrkdal in Vossestrand.  So this connection is not documented in original sources, but is a probably assumption.
1 NOTE Information on Rachel are that 1) the 1880 US Census for Freeborn county list her as Rachel, age 43.  Then, looking at when Rachel's husband, Andrew Davidson, emigrated, he is listed as emigrating in 1868.  Looking at others who e
