1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kjel Larsson married 1789 m. Brita Olavsdr. Evanger b. 1770 and got a skate on Ytre Takla in 1784 for 500 rd. He also had to answer 5 questions. annually for raising his four youngest siblings until they were 14 ye
2 CONC ars old. Kjel was unusually strong and powerful and was "a giant on Voss" in his best days. He did a lot of horse trading, preferably in Western Norway, and made spirits. Kjel died 1814, Brita 1837; they had eight children: Lars b
2 CONC . 1788. Ingebjørg b. 1791, b. 1822 m. Olav Steffason Skjerve, Anna b. 1794, b. m. Johannes Nilsson Istad (America), Olav b. 1796, m. Maria, from Austlandet, was a tambour and traveled to Nordland, Herbrand b. 1801, husbandman in T
2 CONC aklahaga, Anders b. 1803, stayed in 1838 as a timber fluter at Brynabykse in Vossaelvæ, Knut b. 1807, m. Kari Eggjareid (America), Ingjerd b. 1810, m. 1832 m. Per Olavson Skutle, householder at Mala, later traveled to Nordland.
