1 NOTE
2 CONT Funeral services were held Tuesday, July 1, 1975 at the Fawcett Funeral Home in Winona for Mrs. Johanna Ramlo, 98, who died Friday, June 27, 1975 at Winona Community Memorail Hospital.  The Rev. G. H. Huggenvik officiated.  Burial
2 CONC  was in the Hesper Iowa Cemetery.
2 CONT The former Johanna Bjorgan, she was born June 23, 1877 in Noraway, the daughter of John and Ingaberg Bjorgan.  She married Jim T. Ramlo January 19, 1906.  He died in 1941.  Until moving to Winona 30 years ago, she resided at Hespe
2 CONC r, Iowa.  She was a member of the Hesper Lutheran Church.
2 CONT Survivors are one son, James, Spring Grove; three daughters, Mrs. Tilla Brenno, Goodview, MN., Mrs. Clara Brenno, Canton, MN, Mrs. Harlan (Myrtle) Carpenter, Winona; 9 grandchildren and 27 great-grandchildren. Her husband, two son
2 CONC s, twin daughters, one great grandchild and eleven brothers and sisters preceded her in death.
