2 CONT
2 CONT AUSTIN -- The funeral for Arlyss Iola Placek will be at 1 p.m. Friday at Our Savior's Lutheran Church in Austin with the the Rev. Don Deines officiating. Burial will be in Oakwood Cemetery in Austin.
2 CONT Mrs. Placek, 71, of 2000B Burr Oak Drive, a retired Hormel Foods Corp. employee, died Tueday (May 5, 1998) at Austin Medical Center.
2 CONT Arlyss Flatten was born March 12, 1927, in Prosper. She married Robert E. Placek at St. Paul's Lutheran Church in Austin. She was employed at Hormel for 37 years. Mrs. Placek enjoyed traveling, flower gardening, reading, sewing an
2 CONC d cooking.
2 CONT Survivors include two daughters, Terry Placek of Arlington, Va., and Bonni (Mrs. Mike) Cook of Princeton, Minn.; and two grandchildren. She was preceded in death by a brother.
2 CONT Friends may call from 4 p.m. to 8 p.m. Thursday at Mayer Funeral Home in Austin and an hour before the service Friday at the church.
