1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tesdal
2 CONT
2 CONT http://digitalarkivet.no/cgi-win/webcens.exe?slag=visbase&sidenr=22&filnamn=gr12351736&gardpostnr=1&personpostnr=1&merk=1#ovre
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT '''For overview of Tesdal line, consult Kindem’s Vossaboki  IV, Tesdal,  (pages 357, 358, 359)'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT 359 Tesdal.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Endre Øysteinson was g. 1. m. Rannveig Knutsdr., 2. m. Anna Olavsdr. and 3. 1725 m. Kari Styrksdr. Fære.'''  Endre was recorded as primogeniture farmer in the census of 1701 and owned 2 pund. He died in 1736, 63 years gl. and h
2 CONC ad five children with Rannveig, four with Anna and three with Kari.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Olav f. 1727 d. 1792 was one of the children of Endre and Kari.'''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ………….<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT ''The individual bruks.''<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Bruk I.''' Tesdal.  '''Kari, the widow after Endre, was remarried in 1737''' m. Eiliv Olavson Vele who died in 1739, 31 years gl. without descendants.  '''Olav Endreson f. 1727, g. 1753 m. Brita Larsdr. Haug''' bought 1 pund fr
2 CONC om his mother in 1750. '''Olav died in 1792, Brita in 1814, 87 years gl. and had three children:'''  Endre f. 1755, Eirik f. 1758, g. m. Rannveig Johannesdr. Rue and '''Kari f. 1764, g. 1798 m. Velom Eirikson Berge.'''<br/>
2 CONT   (Should read, Velom Eilivson Berge.)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
