1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Spilde, Knute BLOOMINGTON, MINNESOTA - Knute Spilde, age 92, of Bloomington, Minnesota, formerly of Madison, died on January 26, 1990. He is survived by daughters, JoAnne and husband Jack Starry of Minneapolis, Carol Wrend of Pala
2 CONC tine, Illinois; five grandchildren; a great-grandchild; brothers, Alfred of Madison, Russell of Arkansas; and sisters, Grace Topercer of Illinois, and Carrie Berge of Deerfield, Wisconsin. He was preceded in death by his wife, Lyd
2 CONC ia; his parents; and six brothers and three sisters. Funeral services will be held at LAKE EDGE LUTHERAN CHURCH, 4032 Monona Dr., at 11:00 a.m. on Monday, January 29, with Reverend Robert  Voss and Reverend Richard Blomker co-offi
2 CONC ciating. Friends may call from 3:00 until 6:00 p.m. on Sunday at GUNDERSON FUNERAL HOME, 5203 Monona Dr., and one hour prior to service at the church on Monday. Burial will be in Roselawn Memorial Park Cemetery. Memorials preferre
2 CONC d to donors' choice. 
