1 NOTE (Rene) Guri was left in Norway when the others emigrated, because she was not well.    According to Kathleen Lupcho, there is conflicting information about Gurina.  In one place, she was unmarried and died in Montana. In another, 
2 CONC Gurina lived in Norway, having a daughter Adelida, who had two daughters. Kathleen's information was from her Aunt Emma Bakke.  She had no sister Olina listed, contrary to some sources.
