2 DATE 10 NOV 1952
2 PLAC Albert Lea, Freeborn, Minnesota, USA
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Burial record:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GSln=sime&GSfn=john&GSbyrel=all&GSdyrel=all&GSst=25&GScntry=4&GSob=n&GRid=143531415&df=all&
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT He was baptized "Johannes", son of Godskalk Mathiasson from the farm Dugstad (now spelled "Dukstad") in Voss. Godskalk was born on the farm Seim, and apparently used Seim as his surname. The Norwegian pronunciation of "Seim" is si
2 CONC milar to the English pronunciation of "Sime", which Johannes/John apparently used as his surname in America.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT John brought his family to the U.S. in 1882 settling at Northwood, Iowa and moved to Alberta Lea, Minn. in 1884
