1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Donna Ramey:
2 CONT
2 CONT "Helje/Helge Severson was born 29 Jun 1823 Bergen Norway. We have no record of his parents. Children who came with him to America were named Karen Krestina Helgesdatter b 1850, Ola Helgeson b. 1854, Sever "Swen Severson b 1857 Ber
2 CONC gen, and Martinus Helgeson Severson b 1859 Bergen. A younger son Jacob was born after the family arrived in Wisconsin USA in 1861. We believe it is possible that a daughter Sissela Helgesdatter stayed in Norway."
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:NCJJ-J9B Baptism 1824] (familysearch) - Lindås, Norway
