2 CONC  at Digitalarkivet]
2 CONT * [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:NC8M-8J1 Baptism daughter Karen 1851]
2 CONT * [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:VWLL-M9F Baptism daughter Cicilia 1853]
2 CONT * [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:VWLL-QLC Baptism son Ole 1855] 
